        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In case the AC BPT service was selected, unless otherwise stated, anytime an element is prefixed with BPT or AC (e.g. BPT_AC_CPDReqEnergyTransferMode), it shall be used. In case both elements are available exclusively, BPT takes precedence.",
