                    135.0,
                    1123.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The following requirements apply in case of AC_BPT channel is equal to \"separated\" (e.g. dual channel) and the energy transfer needs to move from a charging phase to a discharging phase (or vice-versa):",
