        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In AC energy transfer mode, one could argue that the BPT Channel parameter might not be necessary, as the switch control operation is performed by the SECC. However, in case of a negotiated power profile (scheduled control mode), the EVCC should take into account the physical architecture (e.g. by planning 0 kW steps between charging and discharging phases).",
